#: Behler.md:102
msgid "Implementing angular symmetry functionsa"
msgstr ""

#: Behler.md:104
msgid "One of the angular symmetry functions that Behler introduces is:"
msgstr ""

#: Behler.md:110
msgid ""
"In this expression $\\zeta$, $\\nu$ and $\\lambda$ are all parameters. $f_c$"
" is a switching function which acts upon $R_{ij}$, the distance between atom"
" $i$ and atom $j$, and $R_{ik}$, the distance between atom $i$ and atom $k$."
